## Project Structure

```
InventoryManagement.API
    Controllers, middleware, startup, auth policies, Swagger, CORS, rate limits

InventoryManagement.Application
    Features, handlers, validators, DTOs, persistence interfaces, service abstractions

InventoryManagement.Domain
    Entities and enums

InventoryManagement.Infrastructure
    EF Core DbContext, migrations, repositories, Identity, services

InventoryManagement.Tests
    Unit and integration tests

inventory-web
    React, TypeScript, and Vite frontend
```

