## Roadmap

### Current Baseline

* Clean Architecture and vertical feature slices
* React/Vite frontend with authenticated app shell and company switcher
* ASP.NET Identity, JWT authentication, and refresh token rotation
* Company-scoped roles: Owner, Admin, Manager, Staff, Viewer
* Company invitations, member management, and per-company profile
* Company-isolated master data, transactions, reports, ledgers, and document sequences
* User-owned Free subscription plan with limit-enforcement hooks
* PostgreSQL, Docker, Docker Compose, health checks, rate limiting, and structured logging
* Backend integration tests for core workflows and tenant isolation

### Possible Next Work

* Payment provider integration, checkout, billing portal, and webhooks
* Paid plan management and pricing/upgrade UI
* Email delivery for invitation links
* Ownership and billing-owner transfer workflows
* Per-company tax defaults and document settings
* OpenTelemetry and deeper production observability
* Response caching, API versioning, and CI/CD hardening

---

## Learning Objectives

This project is designed to demonstrate practical experience with:

* Full-stack application architecture
* Multi-company authorization and tenant isolation
* API design with stable public contracts
* CQRS, validation pipelines, and repository-backed persistence
* Inventory, stock, payment, return, and reporting workflows
* SaaS-ready subscription modeling without payment-provider coupling
* Production-minded configuration, logging, health checks, and containerization

